WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.035 --> 00:00:20.719
Mandy, and Wayan's family passed farmers in the fields that surrounded the village.

2
00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:27.605
When they arrived in the center of the village, Vinnie and Mandy stopped to watch two men with

3
00:00:27.705 --> 00:00:30.948
swords. "Are they fighting?"

4
00:00:31.524 --> 00:00:32.265
Vinnie asked.

5
00:00:33.265 --> 00:00:36.688
"Long ago, warriors used to fight with those weapons.

6
00:00:37.849 --> 00:00:41.711
But now they use them for this dance," explained Nyoman.

7
00:00:43.012 --> 00:00:45.734
They all watched the men's careful movements.

8
00:00:46.815 --> 00:00:49.156
Their dance was smooth and graceful.

9
00:00:50.237 --> 00:00:52.799
Finally they reached a large field.

10
00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:56.201
There were many wooden carts on the field.

11
00:00:56.221 --> 00:00:58.303
"We're here!"

12
00:00:58.843 --> 00:00:59.944
Wayan exclaimed.

13
00:01:00.948 --> 00:01:04.309
"Help me tie the bar," his father instructed.

14
00:01:05.389 --> 00:01:09.211
Wayan and Vinnie placed a long bar on the oxen's necks.

15
00:01:10.411 --> 00:01:13.772
The bar connected two long sticks to a small cart.

16
00:01:14.952 --> 00:01:18.933
"Let's take them to the starting line," said Wayan's father.

17
00:01:20.114 --> 00:01:22.975
They joined a group of other men with their oxen.

18
00:01:24.195 --> 00:01:27.476
Wayan's father climbed onto the cart and stood up.

19
00:01:28.640 --> 00:01:31.241
He grabbed the rope reins to steer the team.

20
00:01:31.261 --> 00:01:37.005
"Ready!" shouted an elderly man with a red flag.

21
00:01:38.025 --> 00:01:39.606
He swung the flag down.

22
00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:43.628
All the oxen took off, pulling the carts.

23
00:01:43.648 --> 00:01:45.489
"Go, Budi!

24
00:01:45.729 --> 00:01:46.490
Go, Gede!"

25
00:01:47.210 --> 00:01:48.250
shouted Wayan.

26
00:01:49.451 --> 00:01:52.793
The crowd cheered as the oxen ran down the field.

27
00:01:53.974 --> 00:01:58.376
The race was only 100 meters long, but it was very exciting.

28
00:01:59.808 --> 00:02:00.789
"We won!"

29
00:02:02.129 --> 00:02:04.691
Wayan was jumping up and down with joy.

30
00:02:04.711 --> 00:02:08.713
"Congratulations!" Vinnie yelled.

31
00:02:09.834 --> 00:02:12.575
The other men congratulated Wayan's father.

32
00:02:13.616 --> 00:02:16.497
Wayan and Vinnie went to pet Budi and Gede.

33
00:02:16.517 --> 00:02:21.260
"Help me take this bar off, Vinnie," Wayan asked.

34
00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:24.582
"Let's take the oxen for a walk."

35
00:02:26.243 --> 00:02:28.104
The boys walked through the crowd.

36
00:02:29.296 --> 00:02:32.257
Some villagers stopped to congratulate Wayan.

37
00:02:33.598 --> 00:02:38.960
Meanwhile, Mandy and Nyoman walked among the crowd in the village.

38
00:02:38.980 --> 00:02:41.561
"What happens now?"

39
00:02:42.202 --> 00:02:42.942
asked Mandy.

40
00:02:42.962 --> 00:02:50.105
"Some people will go home and prepare for the Iron Fence festival," explained Nyoman.

41
00:02:50.125 --> 00:02:53.026
"It is being celebrated now.

42
00:02:54.087 --> 00:02:56.668
But my parents will attend a village meeting first."

43
00:02:57.820 --> 00:02:59.461
"What is the meeting about?"

44
00:03:00.021 --> 00:03:00.761
asked Mandy.

45
00:03:00.781 --> 00:03:06.444
"Today it will be about water for the rice fields," said Nyoman.

46
00:03:06.464 --> 00:03:10.465
"But they discuss lots of things at village meetings."

47
00:03:11.686 --> 00:03:14.887
Mandy suddenly realized Vinnie wasn't around.

48
00:03:14.907 --> 00:03:17.608
"Where are the boys?"

49
00:03:18.188 --> 00:03:18.749
she asked.

50
00:03:18.769 --> 00:03:28.428
"Wayan is probably showing off his oxen to his friends," laughed Nyoman.

51
00:03:28.448 --> 00:03:31.170
Soon the girls reached a large, open building.

52
00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:33.512
"What's this place?"

53
00:03:34.232 --> 00:03:34.973
asked Mandy.

54
00:03:34.993 --> 00:03:39.836
"This is the village community hall," replied Nyoman.

55
00:03:39.856 --> 00:03:43.259
"You don't know much about Bali, do you?"

56
00:03:43.279 --> 00:03:46.781
"No," said Mandy.

57
00:03:46.801 --> 00:03:49.483
"This is my first time here.

58
00:03:50.604 --> 00:03:53.185
So I really want to learn about your people."

59
00:03:53.205 --> 00:04:00.121
Nyoman smiled at her and said, "We are very friendly people, Mandy."
